+/*
+ * Opus decoder/encoder CELT functions
+ * Copyright (c) 2012 Andrew D'Addesio
+ * Copyright (c) 2013-2014 Mozilla Corporation
+ * Copyright (c) 2016 Rostislav Pehlivanov <atomnuker@gmail.com>
